  "reference": "Golosayi 2",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "COL 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geagasayi anala gideadeawiiti aba badahuukeagwa, ea badahuuka fuga mida ng'eanyiida Laodikiya, ea giika miighwadaahaniin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda geemajeek gurooruunatka nyaawa, nea gaguuyi aba bariinyeega, ak ghwanyas meanang'oocheanduumeeda sean bea huumwa, ak ghwanal makcheameedida bea ASEETA was Gristohiin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea jeadaanyi ea sifuysa gheaseeda bareaynata uhuuda ea fughareenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gearugu nih aba gideaba adiidu ghoamwaschi gwareenganeegwa siida aba ng'asheega ng'uyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Earapeadi eawooschi sheagi aba heedeang'wean, geendeayi aba guroorooda, ak geahoosanyi muuchi aba gideaba neajeeng'u gidamiyda giibindeang'wa ea gidamajeekta masaweegeagwa aba badayda Gristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibinda hidaat aba jeeda Gristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi agooga ghayi ghoadeapti Gristo Yesu was Ng'utamiida, asi oopiidana jeadaanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea goongooreadi hawungeagwa ak geemajeegeegwa aba jeadaanyi ak gamajeegiit masaweegeagwa, ak gawuurji gidaghayi siinaaldaneegwa, nea goobadiisacheesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ashageada adaghaghaseagwa siida ak gahutaneegwa aba fughareadaanyi bea mwadaagha aba searoojigiga bea buuneedean, aba haleanjeedeaba garayi bea meangeenda mida jeeda ng'eanyiida nea mii dea Gristohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba headaanyi gwanda hidooda sean bea ASEETA nea goobiida badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga ea noanyaschi eaweega hidaat aba badaydeaba niny, nea niny eahaweewa fuga ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida ea gea ambaliischi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba badaydeaba niny eara agooga siyaadeagwa ghasmeahooda aba ghasmeahooda meesinana geatinga, nea ghoanung'waadi ng'asheega saseeda aba ghasmeahooda Gristo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea geepunyeegwa sea niny aba giibaatiisanda, amadu geetuuneegwa sea niny aba masaweega aba gadiyeeda ASEETA, ghayi aduuna niny jeeda miyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean agooga, goomeewayi aba riing'eegeagwa ea aba sasanuukeagwa meayaada ghasmeahooda, iidu ghoadaw ASEETA eaweega sea niny, ak ea nisamseasa riing'eegaasa sean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu nea niibuus ng'ooruutka mida badahuukaasa jea goorgweakseasaan, gageanu ak ghwasach ak goongoorsa uhuuda beehiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoareat fuga mideawa uurda gheambalmeeda dabita ng'ucheeda ak geanu ghoah gichea eahiimda aba eeshpwara aba saawa, ak gahoosan aba badahuuka nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi adagoorgweakseegwa siida aba giinyeashteayda gichea eayaak ghana gichea eali ghana badayda ghweelmeeda ghana aba ng'ushiinda sheeda ghana Sabaato, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "suh jirooneeda ng'asheega jea ghwahidu; nea gida huumwa ea Gristo gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi adaghaweadaneegwa sih gil, aba giimajeekta eateaba geaw bea ng'eanyi ea ghadoowanda malaykajeega, nea ghamiinaada aba giidaheachteaba geaw, nea ghaghwar geaw mwadaagha aba fughareadaanyi bea saseeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea mwanoasa geat sea uhuuda, nea aba niny ghoang'waay geat saseesean aba roobuutka ea mayiishka, ak gwaheedu aba heenooda leabu heeda ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda ak geendeay Gristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama iinoomeewuudayeewi Gristo aba haleanjeeda ng'eanyiida was meangeenda, ghwasaan anda goopiideati gili duu abeaha ng'eanyiida? Ghwasaan inyas ghoamwaschi huumeanyeeka nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adoang'waanyi, ak ea adoosamu, nea adoasachi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ak ghoahiimu haleanjeeda jea goosha iisigadiyeata), aba giduurji giinealshooda buuneeda ea gissirukuteayda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh seaniin aba huumwa gawuurji gwadeagooda mideawa weaghuumeeda ak ghoang'eat ghadooweeda aba eateaba geat bea ng'eanyi aba gidahang'waay gasa saseeda, ak ea marachi gil ak moamu ghoadeal gidida gasa saseedean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
